<details class="order-policy">
  <summary>Cancellation, pickup &amp; order support policy</summary>
  <p><strong>Cancellations:</strong> Email <a href="mailto:contact@crossbellvending.com">contact@crossbellvending.com</a> before shipment or pickup. An order is shipped when handed to the carrier; creating a label alone does not prevent cancellation. Eligible cancellations receive a full refund, including tax and shipping, with no cancellation fee. No cancellations after shipment.</p>
  <p><strong>Damaged or incorrect orders:</strong> No returns. Report issues within 7 days of delivery, including your order number and photos. Each claim and any remedy are subject to manual review and approval. No item return is required.</p>
  <p><strong>Response time:</strong> We review requests and initiate approved refunds within 3 business days. Your bank may take additional time to post the refund.</p>
  <p><strong>Missing packages:</strong> Email us so we can investigate with the carrier. Any remedy is decided after manual review.</p>
  <p><strong>Pickup:</strong> Orders are held for 14 days. We will contact you, then manually cancel and refund if the order remains uncollected.</p>
</details>
